<title>SOUTH KOREA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF SOUTH KOREAN PRO-SOCCER GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean professional</p>
<p>soccer games played on Sunday.</p>
<p> Samsung     2    Yukong	1   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p> Daewoo	2    Chonbuk     0   (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Sunday (Tabulate under -</p>
<p>won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Daewoo		4     1    0     8     1    13</p>
<p> Hyundai	     3     2    0     6     1    11</p>
<p> Samsung	     3     1    1     4     3    10</p>
<p> Pohang		2     2    1     6     4     8</p>
<p> Taejon		1     3    1     3     4     6</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     1     2    2     5     6     5</p>
<p> Chonnam	     1     2    2     4     5     5</p>
<p> LG		    0     4    1     5     6     4</p>
<p> Yukong		0     2    3     4    10     2</p>
<p> Ilwha		 0     1    4     1     6     1</p>
